# Documentation & Mapping Roadmap

This document serves as the bridge between the C source code and the public documentation for the ocean mapping project. It tracks our progress in ensuring that all core technologies are accurately represented on the website.

## 1. Core Inventory (Codebase Map)
The following table maps our codebase to its primary functions:

| Category | Included Components | Primary Functionality |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Core Engine** | `glSeis`, `SEIS_watercolumn`, `SEIS_launcher` | Core rendering engine, geometry handling, and viewer integration. |
| **Mapping/Display** | `cmaps`, `CnCcolorMap` | Translating raw data into meaningful visualizations (scaling, colorization). |
| **Pipeline/Utils** | `mkbp`, `EM_unpack`, `mv` tools | Data ingestion, batch processing scripts, and file conversions. |

